OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785338295
OL,3,CAt least 13 killed and more missing
OL,4,Cafter major earthquake struck southern
OL,5,CJapan
OL,7,FAt least 13 people have died and many
OL,8,Fmore are missing or injured after a
OL,9,Fpowerful earthquake struck
OL,10,Fsouthwestern Japan on Wednesday.
OL,12,FSoldiers and emergency workers
OL,13,Fsearched a heavily damaged shopping
OL,14,Fcentre and collapsed homes for trapped
OL,15,Fsurvivors.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
