PN,31502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785338295
OL,3,CAt least 13 killed and more missing
OL,4,Cafter major earthquake struck southern
OL,5,CJapan
OL,7,FBullet train services and some airport
OL,8,Foperations remained suspended as
OL,9,Fauthorities continued to assess the
OL,10,Fdamage a day after the magnitude 7.1
OL,11,Fearthquake struck the Kumamoto region
OL,12,Fon Japan's southern main island of
OL,13,FKyushu.
OL,15,F"There are people who are still
OL,16,Fwaiting to be rescued, and it's a race
OL,17,Fagainst time," Prime Minister Sanae
OL,18,FTakaichi said.
OL,20,F"We will go all out to find and rescue
OL,21,Fas many people as we can."
OL,26,@wD@AOUyD@NO]|D@AOU}D@ZO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
