PN,31503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785338295
OL,3,CAt least 13 killed and more missing
OL,4,Cafter major earthquake struck southern
OL,5,CJapan
OL,7,FApproximately 36,900 homes remain
OL,8,Fwithout electricity, while 9,500 are
OL,9,Fwithout gas, and communications
OL,10,Fnetworks are still down in some areas,
OL,11,Faccording to chief government
OL,12,Fspokesman Minoru Kihara.
OL,14,FMore than 9,000 people had taken
OL,15,Fshelter at over 500 evacuation centres.
OL,17,FKihara said additional power supplies
OL,18,Fwere being installed to ensure the
OL,19,Fcentres had air conditioning, as
OL,20,Ftemperatures in the region were
OL,21,Fforecast to exceed 32C.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
