PN,31504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785338295
OL,3,CAt least 13 killed and more missing
OL,4,Cafter major earthquake struck southern
OL,5,CJapan
OL,7,FJapan's Self-Defence Forces joined
OL,8,Femergency crews searching for
OL,9,Fsurvivors at the heavily damaged Aeon
OL,10,FMall in the town of Kashima.
OL,12,FThe shopping centre's second floor
OL,13,Fcollapsed after an explosion believed
OL,14,Fto have been caused by a gas leak,
OL,15,Ftrapping an unknown number of people.
OL,17,FAt the Nippon Paper Industries factory
OL,18,Fin Yatsushiro, a collapsed chimney
OL,19,Ftrapped several people under rubble,
OL,20,Faccording to the Kumamoto emergency
OL,21,Fteam.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
