PN,31505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785338295
OL,3,CAt least 13 killed and more missing
OL,4,Cafter major earthquake struck southern
OL,5,CJapan
OL,7,FAs of Wednesday, seven people were
OL,8,Fbelieved to remain trapped. Two
OL,9,Fsurvivors and two bodies had been
OL,10,Frecovered, officials said.
OL,12,FPrime Minister Takaichi said the
OL,13,Fgovernment was preparing to deliver
OL,14,Ffood and other essential supplies to
OL,15,Fthe worst-affected areas.
OL,17,FShe also offered her condolences to
OL,18,Fthe victims and their families and
OL,19,Furged those affected to take care in
OL,20,Fthe heat.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/7
