OL,3,CAt least 13 killed and more missing
OL,4,Cafter major earthquake struck southern
OL,5,CJapan
OL,7,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,8,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,9,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,10,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,12,FThe Kyushu Shinkansen bullet train
OL,13,Fremained suspended on Wednesday.
OL,15,FAso Kumamoto Airport resumed
OL,16,Foperations after closing one of its
OL,17,Frunways on Tuesday, although officials
OL,18,Fwarned some flights could still be
OL,19,Fcancelled.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/7
