OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785338295
OL,3,CAt least 13 killed and more missing
OL,4,Cafter major earthquake struck southern
OL,5,CJapan
OL,7,FStone walls at Kumamoto Castle, one of
OL,8,Fthe region's main tourist attractions,
OL,9,Fwere damaged in the earthquake.
OL,11,FThe landmark was badly affected by the
OL,12,F2016 quake and is still undergoing
OL,13,Frepairs, according to Kyodo News.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/7
